Parallel lines are those in a plane which do not meet, however far produced.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"c0c5c78e-4493-4df6-b333-5723d2e4e3e4"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
